## Project Description
This program monitors simulated device temperature readings for a Computer Engineering laboratory. It stores sensor data, validates inputs, classifies each reading as NORMAL, WARNING, or CRITICAL, and generates a detailed numerical summary with an overall status indicator.
 
## Features
- View all stored temperature readings with index positions.
- Add a new valid reading (whole numbers from 0 to 100 only).
- Classify every reading based on strict boundary parameters.
- Generate numerical summaries, category percentages, and status reports.
- Robust input validation rejecting wrong menu inputs and invalid numeric ranges.
 
